Statement of modification
-------------------------

  donor.py IS A MODIFIED DERIVATIVE of the file named above. The derivative
  work adds bounded Q-network guidance to `_role_plan`: `animal_gate` may block
  new herd roles and `seed_scale` may reduce new crop roles. Existing plants and
  animals remain assigned so learned choices cannot suppress their field care.
  With the default guidance, role planning remains action-for-action compatible
  with the upstream policy.

  market_exec.py IS A MODIFIED DERIVATIVE of the `_market_actions` function in
  that file. The derivative work threads the same learned `MarketModifier` and
  a learned per-product sell reserve through the original decision rules:

    - the sell loop retains `reserves[item]` units before sizing the sale,
      and skips retention while liquidating;
    - `_seed_needs` counts are scaled by `modifier.seed_scale`;
    - `_target_hands` is offset by `modifier.hand_delta`;
    - the animal-purchase gate is overridden by `modifier.animal_gate`;
    - the land-purchase day gate is shifted by `modifier.land_bias`;
    - `FEED_STOCK_DAYS` is replaced by `modifier.feed_days` when sizing wheat;
    - seed and operating cash reserves are scaled by `modifier.cash_floor`.

  Every other file in this directory is original work of this repository.
